{"id":"ia4bpye2hnapkjfpd7zrjo53t","title":"北京科学宣言——科学为谁而存在","originalTitle":"[转载]《北京科学宣言》——新的开始，新的长征","summary":"《北京科学宣言》强调科学是人类共同事业，科学惠益应由全人类共享，呼吁科学成为支撑可持续发展的力量。宣言指出，科学不是悬浮于社会之上的象牙塔，而是内在于世界的社会实践，面对气候变化等复杂挑战，科学需进一步衔接全球科学体系与可持续发展议程。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=3662611&do=blog&id=1560624"},"publishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":"2026-11-11T01:11:29.907Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-11T01:11:29.907Z","category":null,"tags":["论文发表"],"score":46,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}